{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fictional map based on the southern regions of Ukraine, which include arid areas, steppe regions, and forested areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The entire section is modeled after real segments such as Kyiv - Smila, Melitopol - Novooleksiivka, Piatykhatky - Rokuvaata (Kryvyi Rih). This route includes 120 km of main tracks, of which 50 km are electrified with direct current, and 70 km with alternating current.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Main features of the map:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- High vegetation detail</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Diverse landscape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Excellent sound design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Atmospheric locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes 2 base sessions. The rolling stock in operation includes passenger locomotives ChS4, ChS8, freight locomotives VL80S, VL82, 2ES5K (AC), and ChS7, ChS2 - passenger, VL10, VL8, VL11M6 - freight (DC) locomotives VL80S, VL82, 2ES5K (AC), and ChS7, ChS2, VL10, VL8, VL11M6 (DC).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609360?t=1743737360","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609360?t=1743737360","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609360/696dd70e4e8073b8f00adcbc062e7eaa24b266f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743737360","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609360/696dd70e4e8073b8f00adcbc062e7eaa24b266f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743737360","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_de